==English==
{{wikipedia}}
{{commonscat}}
{{root|en|ine-pro|*h₂engʷʰ-}}

===Etymology===
Borrowed from {{bor|en|la|anguilla||[[eel]]}}, from an {{unc|en|nocap=1}} Romance language original. The name of the island refers to its elongated shape.

===Pronunciation===
